@startuml offering-customer-need-boundary
title Offering / Customer Need Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 8

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Customer Need" as CN
class "Offering" as O

CN --> O : is-addressed-by
O --> CN : addresses
O -[dotted]- CN : is NOT
CN -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 8:
  Offering addresses Customer Need. The Customer Need is what
  the Offering addresses, but an Offering is NOT a Customer Need.
end note

@enduml
